ABSTRACT_EN = (
    "This work presents a mobile collaborative multi-agent system for coal mine safety document review and field risk assessment. The system combines structured document parsing, multi-granularity knowledge organization, retrieval-augmented reasoning, tool verification and human feedback. A master agent plans the review workflow and coordinates professional agents for compliance checking, typo detection, duplication analysis, numerical verification and revision suggestions. The Web client supports document review and feedback, while the WeChat mini program submits text, voice and images for on-site risk judgment."
)

